# StudyForge Support

Python FastAPI + Postgres (pgvector + FTS). Sibling of StudyForge. Spec: [docs/architecture.md](docs/architecture.md). Terms: [CONTEXT.md](CONTEXT.md). Handbook: [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) (read on demand).

## Commands

```bash
docker compose up --build
ruff check app
ruff format app
pytest
```

## Must follow

- Firebase ID tokens. Staff = `role: admin`. Users only see their tickets.
- How-it-works answers only from retrieved Help chunks. Cite titles. No invented credits.
- Do not embed ticket text. Do not import `@study-forge`.
- Never commit secrets. This app is not Firebase Hosting.
- No MUI. v1 has no Postgres RLS (API enforces access).

